{"output":"I’ll inspect authorization and project-list caching, fix the isolation gaps, and run the existing tests without changing them or installing dependencies.\n\nProject detail reads lack an ownership check, and updates reuse that unchecked read. List authorization is already in place, but cache keys omit the organization and updates never invalidate lists. I’ll fix those paths and add regression tests for revoked membership, list variants, and organization IDs with shared prefixes or punctuation.\n\nFixed ownership authorization for project reads and updates. List caching now isolates organizations, preserves pagination and sorting, and invalidates all variants only for the updated organization. Authorization remains checked before cache access.\n\nAdded regression tests; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 11 tests. git diff --check passed. Exit code 0; no blockers.","final_output":"Fixed ownership authorization for project reads and updates. List caching now isolates organizations, preserves pagination and sorting, and invalidates all variants only for the updated organization. Authorization remains checked before cache access.\n\nAdded regression tests; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 11 tests. git diff --check passed. Exit code 0; no blockers.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":9,"tool_calls":[{"name":"skill","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"pwd; git status --short; ls -a; find .. -name AGENTS.md -print","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-batching-iincv9nu/tenant-cache-1-optimized/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":425,"stdout_bytes":134,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-972c4b8905ef064adee179251cba6e54.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},